  "description": "Polly v8 reconnect policy for SignalR. Replaces SignalR's fixed-array WithAutomaticReconnect with a full Polly v8 retry pipeline — exponential back-off, jitter, configurable max retries, max delay, and per-attempt timeout. Also provides StartWithResilienceAsync for resilient initial connections.",
